Principally, it was contended that the State of Haryana has notified Dharuhera Revenue Estate as a Municipal Committee Town in 2007; that the acquired land was located on a prime stretch near developed sectors and industrial areas in Dharuhera and had a significant development potential;
Ram Kishan (Since Deceased) Through His ... vs State Of Haryana on 3 April, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/108050923/
